- TESS data from MAST (STScI): public, with acknowledgement.
- TESS-SPOC, QLP and TGLC high-level science products: CC BY 4.0.
- Gaia DR3 (ESA/Gaia/DPAC): CC BY-NC 3.0 IGO, for non-commercial use only.
- NASA Exoplanet Archive, ExoFOP-TESS, AAVSO VSX and CDS services:
